  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support an FCDO programme funded role (On Temporary Duty)
seconded into the UN 2720 Mechanism for Gaza.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FCDO Programme-funded role will be on temporary duty seconded into the UN 2720 Mechanism for Gaza. United Nations Security Council Resolution 2720 (2023) mandated the establishment of a Mechanism for Gaza with the objective of &#x201c;accelerating the provision of humanitarian relief consignments to the Gaza Strip through states which are not party to the conflict, consulting all relevant parties, to expedite, streamline, and accelerate the process of providing assistance while continuing to help ensure that aid reaches its civilian destination.&#x201d; The setup of the Mechanism follows a modular and phased approach. Its operationalisation allows for pipeline prioritisation, predictability, visibility and tracking of increased humanitarian assistance into Gaza. The Mechanism is facilitating the expansion of aid corridors into Gaza through Cyprus, Egypt and Jordan.
As mandated by SCR 2720 (2023), the Office of the Senior Humanitarian and
Reconstruction Coordinator has offices inside Gaza, which will open soon, as part of the Mechanism, and includes operational capacity to allow support for monitoring and verification inside Gaza.</narrative>
  </description>
